{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42111","headline":"从驾东幸呈诸公 · 徐铉","name":"从驾东幸呈诸公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吴公台下旧京城，曾掩衡门过十春。\n别後不知新景象，信来空问故交亲。\n宦游京口无高兴，习隐锺山限俗尘。\n今日喜爲华表鹤，况陪鵷鹭免迷津。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42111.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42111","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}